    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the hotline stuff doesn't change the reality though. it doesn't fix the fact that i'm bankrupt and my entire life is a lie now. i just feel like i've lost all my dignity. everyone i knew sees me as this joke. it's like i'm stuck in this permanent state of humiliation and there's no way to fix it.",
