    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how can it be temporary when the damage is so complete? i'm not talking about a bad month or a tough year, i mean everything. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, just a walking disaster. the embarrassment of having to crawl back and explain myself to everyone... it's just so exhausting. sometimes i think it would be more decent to just stop before it gets even worse, you know? like, to just end the story before the next chapter is just more shame.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
